State machine is clean, read it twice. Two things:

1. Jitter: you call random.random() per attempt but seed once per process, so two workers restarted together retry in lockstep. Per-connector RNG, or seed from os.urandom.
2. On the 8th failure we set degraded but the last error message is lost. Log it before the transition, it's the one message anyone will want.

Otherwise approved 👌

Sofia

